7d2aa87d08928942817","type":"message","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"output_text","annotations":[],"logprobs":[],"text":"Put \\(r=xyz\\). Since \\(x+y+z=9\\) and \\(xy+yz+zx=14\\),\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\nE&=\\sum_{\\rm cyc}\\left(x+y-\\frac{2xy}{x+y}\\right)\n=18-2\\sum_{\\rm cyc}\\frac{xy}{9-z}\\\\\n&=18-2\\frac{196+9r}{126-r}.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\nIndeed, the common denominator is\n\\[\n(9-x)(9-y)(9-z)=126-r,\n\\]\nand the numerator is\n\\[\n\\sum_{\\rm cyc}xy(9-x)(9-y)\n=81(14)-9(9\\cdot14-3r)+(14^2-18r)=196+9r.\n\\]\nThe denominator is positive, and\n\\[\n\\frac{dE}{dr}=-\\frac{2660}{(126-r)^2}<0,\n\\]\nso we must maximize \\(xyz\\).\n\nConsider the compact feasible set with \\(x,y,z\\ge0\\). Its boundary has \\(xyz=0\\), whereas positive feasible triples exist. Thus the maximum of \\(xyz\\) is interior. The constraint gradients are independent: otherwise \\(x=y=z=3\\), contradicting \\(xy+yz+zx=14\\). Lagrange multipliers therefore give\n\\[\nyz=\\lambda+\\mu(y+z),\\quad\nxz=\\lambda+\\mu(x+z),\\quad\nxy=\\lambda+\\mu(x+y).\n\\]\nSubtracting shows that if all three variables were distinct, all would equal \\(\\mu\\), a contradiction. Hence two variables are equal.\n\nWrite \\(x=y=a\\), \\(z=9-2a\\). Then\n\\[\na^2+2a(9-2a)=14\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\na=3\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt{39}}3.\n\\]\nThe plus sign makes \\(z<0\\); consequently the maximum occurs, up to permutation, at\n\\[\na=3-\\frac{\\sqrt{39}}3,\\qquad b=3+\\frac{2\\sqrt{39}}3.\n\\]\nAt this triple,\n\\[\nE_{\\min}\n=a+\\frac{2(a^2+b^2)}{a+b}\n=\\frac{1557-39\\sqrt{39}}{95}.\n\\]\n\nFinal answer: \\(\\displaystyle \\boxed{\\frac{1557-39\\sqrt{39}}{95}}\\)."}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":1,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":176,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":0,"cached_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1372,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":833},"total_tokens":1548},"user":null,"metadata":{}}
